<mxfile><diagram id="arch" name="Modified components"><mxGraphModel dx="1700" dy="800" grid="0" page="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="800"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c11" value="UERANSIM 3.2.7" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#14213D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="340" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Open5GS 2.7.2 (5G core)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#14213D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="20" width="660" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="FreeRADIUS 3.2.6 (DN-AAA)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#14213D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="20" width="340" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="Application Server" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#14213D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="20" width="260" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;nr-ue (UE): EDHOC initiator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;src/ue/nas/sm/transport.cpp&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• handles PDU Session Authentication Command, sends Complete; EAP result in Establishment Accept/Reject&lt;br&gt;• runs EAP-EDHOC Message1–4, EAP fragmentation&lt;br&gt;• writes NEXT before Message3, promotes after Message4, fallback on EAP-Failure&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;src/ue/nas/sm/sm.hpp, establishment.cpp&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• EDHOC session state, MSK/EMSK, DN-specific EAP identity&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;src/lib/nas/eap.cpp/.hpp&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• new EAP type 56 (EapEdhoc)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;CMakeLists.txt&lt;/i&gt;: links libedhoc4&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE3CF;strokeColor=#B5570F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="60" width="310" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;nr-gnb (gNB)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;src/lib/sctp/internal.cpp&lt;/i&gt;: SCTP_NODELAY on NGAP&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE3CF;strokeColor=#B5570F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="360" width="310" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;AMF&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;src/amf/namf-handler.c&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• forwards PDU Session Authentication Command (N1-only N1N2MessageTransfer) as DL NAS Transport&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE3CF;strokeColor=#B5570F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="395" y="60" width="280" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Unchanged NFs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUSF, UDM, UDR: primary authentication (5G-AKA)&lt;br&gt;NSSF, NRF: slice selection, SMF discovery&lt;br&gt;PCF, SCP, BSF&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Only configuration (YAML paths, DNN, S-NSSAI); no code changes.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEEEEE;strokeColor=#9A9A9A;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="395" y="230" width="280" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;SMF: EAP authenticator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;src/smf/gsm-sm.c&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• state wait_5gc_sec_auth: inside PDU session establishment (TS 23.502 step 6)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;src/smf/gsm-build.c, namf-handler.c&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Authentication Command; EAP-Success in Accept, EAP-Failure in Reject #29&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;src/smf/radius-client.c/.h (new)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• non-blocking relay to the UPF over a persistent socket&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE3CF;strokeColor=#B5570F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="60" width="305" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;UPF: RADIUS client sidecar&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;src/upf/eap-relay.c/.h (new)&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;init.c, meson.build&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• RADIUS Access-Request with User-Name, State, EAP-Message (RFC 3579), Message-Authenticator&lt;br&gt;• persistent socket, Identifier matching; 253-byte EAP attributes&lt;br&gt;• Access-Challenge/Accept/Reject → SMF&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE3CF;strokeColor=#B5570F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="300" width="305" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;rlm_eap_edhoc (new EAP module)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;src/modules/rlm_eap/types/rlm_eap_edhoc/&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• EDHOC responder, methods 0–4&lt;br&gt;• selects the per-UE record by EAP identity&lt;br&gt;• commits the rotated record before Message4, no grace key&lt;br&gt;• exports MSK (MS-MPPE keys) and EMSK&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;libeap/eap_types.h&lt;/i&gt;: type 56 (EDHOC)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;raddb/mods-available/eap&lt;/i&gt;: edhoc section&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCEBFA;strokeColor=#1F5FA8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1075" y="60" width="310" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Per-UE key database (new)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;db&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;identity&amp;gt;/: one-time keys, fdatasync&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCEBFA;strokeColor=#1F5FA8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1075" y="265" width="310" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;rlm_eap_tls: unchanged&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;EAP-TLS baselines&lt;br&gt;OpenSSL 3.0.13 (Classic)&lt;br&gt;OpenSSL 3.2.6 + oqs-provider (Hybrid PQC)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEEEEE;strokeColor=#9A9A9A;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1075" y="335" width="310" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;EMSK bootstrapping (new)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;bootstrap/&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• aaa_keyexport: EMSK → USRK → DSRK&lt;br&gt;• app_server: OSCORE context&lt;br&gt;• ue_client: UE side&lt;br&gt;• no further login&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCEBFA;strokeColor=#1F5FA8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1435" y="60" width="230" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Shared crypto core (new): edhoc4/, edhoc03&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;libedhoc4&lt;/b&gt; (method 4): X-Wing KEM (X25519 + ML-KEM-768), ML-DSA-44, EAD_1/EAD_2 key rotation, AES-128-GCM, HKDF; &lt;b&gt;edhoc4_db&lt;/b&gt;: two-slot CUR/NEXT record with fdatasync&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;edhoc03&lt;/b&gt; (methods 0–3): X25519, Ed25519, static DH&lt;br&gt;Built on PQClean (ML-KEM-768, ML-DSA-44), libsodium, mbedTLS; KAT and self-tests (xwing_kat, selftest, dbtest)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;The same library is linked into nr-ue and rlm_eap_edhoc, byte for byte&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCEBFA;strokeColor=#1F5FA8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="500" width="1020" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Benchmark harness (new): benchmark/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;e2e_radius_bench&lt;/b&gt;: EAP peer + RADIUS client, methods 0–4, loss emulation, forced drop of Message3/4&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;eap_tls_bench / eap_tls_hybrid_bench&lt;/b&gt;: EAP-TLS Classic / Hybrid PQC&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;crypto_bench, m4_inproc_bench, storage_ablation, bootstrap_bench&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCEBFA;strokeColor=#1F5FA8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacin